00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:10,717
we've been commanded to purge his enemies
from the width and breadth of Upper Yard.

512
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:12,660
We are Lord Eneru's Elite.

513
00:32:13,420 --> 00:32:15,420
There is no place for you to hide.

514
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:21,420
We possess the power of the Axtile,
which is not found in Skypiea.

515
00:32:22,900 --> 00:32:24,280
Out of my way!

516
00:32:26,520 --> 00:32:28,220
Your efforts are futile.

517
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:29,660
Your shot's useless.

518
00:32:31,520 --> 00:32:32,350
Axtile!

519
00:32:33,140 --> 00:32:35,220
Your shield won't help you!

520
00:32:56,180 --> 00:32:59,737
Oh, the islands in the south are warm.

521
00:32:59,820 --> 00:33:02,577
And their heads get really hot.

522
00:33:02,660 --> 00:33:05,897
They grow up pineapples,
they grow up coconuts.

523
00:33:05,980 --> 00:33:08,180
And they're morons?

524
00:33:10,680 --> 00:33:12,120
A goat?

525
00:33:12,460 --> 00:33:13,620
Was that a goat?

526
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:14,920
Where is it?

527
00:33:18,260 --> 00:33:19,200
Here go!

528
00:33:29,800 --> 00:33:31,080
Who's this jerk?

529
00:33:31,360 --> 00:33:32,948
Man, he got me all excited.

530
00:33:33,220 --> 00:33:35,580
I thought I was gonna get to see a goat.

531
00:33:38,520 --> 00:33:39,520
Next verse.

532
00:33:39,820 --> 00:33:42,097
Islands in the north are snowy.

533
00:33:42,180 --> 00:33:44,877
And their heads get really cold!

534
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:50,620
They're very chilly-chilly, they're
very willy-nilly, and they're idiots!

535
00:33:55,100 --> 00:33:56,540
Oh, it's you.

536
00:33:57,760 --> 00:33:58,800
That's right.

537
00:33:59,080 --> 00:34:01,260
And just what are you doing here?

538
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:06,120
I warned you to leave
this island. Shut up!

539
00:34:06,460 --> 00:34:08,060
I can do whatever I want!

540
00:34:08,340 --> 00:34:09,440
No, you can't.

541
00:34:09,660 --> 00:34:14,720
This island belongs to us
Shandians. Huh? Really? It does?

542
00:34:15,080 --> 00:34:16,840
I thought it was God's.

543
00:34:17,200 --> 00:34:19,420
Well then, I beg your pardon.

544
00:34:22,080 --> 00:34:23,100
Next verse!

545
00:34:23,460 --> 00:34:26,480
Islands in the east of
- Hold it! Oh, what?

546
00:34:29,060 --> 00:34:29,890
No.

547
00:34:30,120 --> 00:34:32,317
I'm through wasting words on you.

548
00:34:32,400 --> 00:34:35,988
And I'm sick and tired of
listening to your idiotic babbling.

549
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:39,780
So I'm gonna destroy you.

550
00:34:40,400 --> 00:34:41,420
I see.

551
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:50,146
If you want to fight,
you just have to say so.
